      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "16",
      "locator": "paragraph 16",
      "text": "Jill's Platform",
      "sha256": "661fddcc16118c04b0405b2dc06e473db3ce1fab363b89a2deeaad2c3319358d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "56c3e72c2f20211f5bca21fc",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "17",
      "locator": "paragraph 17",
      "text": "Get Involved",
      "sha256": "4dd77d3ae0c4dd3f77c1803a2f837ea91ecd1bb8549826eaf458dc5f14b1ccbb"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "9db8cf4ce5000f2ea7c9c9bb",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "18",
      "locator": "paragraph 18",
      "text": "Merch",
      "sha256": "1b999f771518f9cbcd637fe526a7fae995c74fc40f2fa638ee631d90a30cd047"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "268c4dc028130844cfcc46e0",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "19",
      "locator": "paragraph 19",
      "text": "DONATE",
      "sha256": "68273151ba9e5b8b4be02a8b29b432e6fb2ff029d75c3eaa3514dc6052d52db2"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4e290d6084b5f539a98cc9c9",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "20",
      "locator": "paragraph 20",
      "text": "MY PLATFORM",
      "sha256": "17db4df257e73575e37b8c46da41f5bdd3bc8a7490c8d8e475e0aeb5fe23d880"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "78d9956718f6da47700be1b9",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "21",
      "locator": "paragraph 21",
      "text": "My perspective is that, despite what some may want you to believe, we all have more in common than we think. Reasonable minds can disagree, but government is about finding consensus. Here’s what I know most Idahoans can get behind.",
      "sha256": "c766829583799115aaed682306ed43d4bdf9fc04ac258ff0a9a090bec1d5b78d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "7fc02796e955af7f38c7de1c",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "22",
      "locator": "paragraph 22",
      "text": "Lower costs. Fair taxes. Strong schools. Real infrastructure.",
      "sha256": "53801be8ab7981bf08a2cdd0bb44aaabff1c127784b351edcadba75995c5ae1f"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "7d2b647a5535dd9905d19c14",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "23",
      "locator": "paragraph 23",
      "text": "Idaho can be fiscally responsible and make life more affordable for working families. My focus is straightforward: rebalance the budget so the people who keep Idaho running aren’t carrying the heaviest load, make it easier to start and raise a family here, and invest in the basics that help communities thrive.",
      "sha256": "c87b2a7a65eab45250c1e336fa832200251360fb677920d14efeff2ba7a39cf5"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "454761e8becf4552223e093d",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "24",
      "locator": "paragraph 24",
      "text": "1) Rebalancing Idahos’ Budget",
      "sha256": "3fa6a511a29085d013eb540c4f9f0137f16a83a00c1ee03b59edca2b7536e10b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "25f7261ee32c9327298f3a05",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "25",
      "locator": "paragraph 25",
      "text": "A tax system that’s fairer—and relief where families feel it most.",
      "sha256": "b1baab993c7816db87c3cf72d2fcb3d1600ac2faaab7c4fceb98972624afdc46"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "72308193d15bb877dc686bea",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "26",
      "locator": "paragraph 26",
      "text": "End the flat tax and replace it with a system that’s fairer in terms of who pays what . Idaho shouldn’t balance the budget on the backs of the middle class and the working poor.",
      "sha256": "c357f2f3e61ac06f624186c518406e0633f4b546d08ccc62548666b916c1a0f1"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "6710baf90b1f073ae144bb13",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "27",
      "locator": "paragraph 27",
      "text": "Use “triggers” for tax changes so Idaho only cuts taxes when we can actually afford it—protecting schools, healthcare, and public safety from boom-and-bust budgeting.",
      "sha256": "fd95b2982b82f26476f3346e20f584b31da0e8139508b6f9b3b806dabaa5c92b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5290529158261355e41e9ef3",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "28",
      "locator": "paragraph 28",
      "text": "Grocery tax relief so families keep more of what they earn when they buy essentials.",
      "sha256": "470afc6751bffd5e5f082a049f1a3eacc1026f21ae8251c31337d839588da9ac"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2f80aefcfe50f63244c7153d",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "29",
      "locator": "paragraph 29",
      "text": "Energy usage tax relief to lower utility-related costs that hit working households the hardest.",
      "sha256": "a0e2e4199ecd72e29a2018ab773c31f2dd338d1fd217578be7ecc92965bd3f95"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "f055f367ff09d7b004fa6bdc",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "30",
      "locator": "paragraph 30",
      "text": "Shift the tax burden away from ALICE families ( Asset Limited, Income Constrained, Employed ) who work hard but still struggle to cover basic costs.",
      "sha256": "0be00731efd4e8e72c235f4d1b443365fe2f956bf6f0b4a55d65d3075f52ede5"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "26c6c60525d60be1440dd4c6",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "31",
      "locator": "paragraph 31",
      "text": "2) Making It Easier to Start a Family",
      "sha256": "84f937a94af25feef38ecab04ad4edda29dfec0501d156cbae4fb0dc82053e7c"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d8d5decae57e5b26e78e548d",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "32",
      "locator": "paragraph 32",
      "text": "Because Idaho should be a place where families can plan for the future.",
      "sha256": "1af43d0cdfdcad0856ace9e73f462e9a8484a876eeb2b7a6f206d0d06aed9298"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5cdbd986ac161d36b43cac24",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "33",
      "locator": "paragraph 33",
      "text": "Public schools that work so every child, in every ZIP code, has a real shot.",
      "sha256": "0ddecbcd7d5dac55d846aae0bc622f19499cfbbd438b987762fe1fd3d1f57b7e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2b346a19c03ce26c7cdb615c",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "34",
      "locator": "paragraph 34",
      "text": "Attainable housing by increasing supply responsibly:",
      "sha256": "8d942b84eb79a0e414c3b931c1fa25a069e3a75da2701ada2085046c7c9f7f8e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "e47fd42cb84d09f7d45b2595",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "35",
      "locator": "paragraph 35",
      "text": "Cut red tape that blocks homes from being built.",
      "sha256": "6a9949fe572617ae4cd0f8d69670f85965a1c49ed81b71d6c1fe71e0a221a8cb"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "dc04f133df9d26e4504f694c",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "36",
      "locator": "paragraph 36",
      "text": "Recognize the real issues driving prices up and address them head-on.",
      "sha256": "9da157948201d2869edddfb54991deaec96fb5bc3a2b5c8709a89279185fee43"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "79d3ac19f3f674f2333fc552",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "37",
      "locator": "paragraph 37",
      "text": "Rural healthcare that’s accessible and reliable—because no Idahoan should have to drive hours for basic care.",
      "sha256": "a614866fca9be2015005ced06f80703f69c38167776b93012d0fad658b26b263"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3f1b4d1b5512b14db5d6468f",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "38",
      "locator": "paragraph 38",
      "text": "3) Investing in What Matters",
      "sha256": "8493fd917f30f30cf89d8f80a01e46ae11653ede639f95d1056abb2380dade7d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "51937b3073823c5f5fdf93ad",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "39",
      "locator": "paragraph 39",
      "text": "Build the foundation for growth—physical and digital.",
      "sha256": "4d640ed3b8cd45c829cca03e548d233f8a63d6d3ec62bbf7abddf726658ac7f8"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "81221434eef4c6ea6f181686",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "40",
      "locator": "paragraph 40",
      "text": "Infrastructure that keeps Idaho moving:",
      "sha256": "0b066ba13447de8e6dd8d799578b403c2bdee0f0b9ad049770a39a7a97a02efb"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "eb634a5b9590f26974f519b6",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "41",
      "locator": "paragraph 41",
      "text": "Roads and bridges",
      "sha256": "43adf1b5fab286041b1295ebdebc18f6b95b55309a3ac5b2e36e85933e0189fc"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "858d88b5aa7cf135c2cbd352",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "42",
      "locator": "paragraph 42",
      "text": "Critical maintenance and upgrades",
      "sha256": "86f41c63dee5fa13f20c5e6d18e607f20b0203d6fa8e7503dd46b9c782785072"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "2c61fd001027b35bbf613b77",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "43",
      "locator": "paragraph 43",
      "text": "Digital infrastructure so rural and small-town Idaho can compete, learn, and do business.",
      "sha256": "792ba2493402e70a3ee30f89b7376f2567686e721546459a542fe6788da3a241"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d02944db6c369f1e9d58419c",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "44",
      "locator": "paragraph 44",
      "text": "School facilities that are safe, modern, and built for student success.",
      "sha256": "346a8b3983d011f03c94e6208168bbc78eafc54591d1b310d2ee9f3b26b7efb8"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ac77c6c1d5562e9adeee3d9f",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "45",
      "locator": "paragraph 45",
      "text": "Water solutions, both novel and tested to ensure sustainable water resources.",
      "sha256": "ef7bd05f012c2cdae688810d22b4cf6faaaafe94442972b88c737c78ce546d71"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "968b4d6632cf809006b562a8",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "46",
      "locator": "paragraph 46",
      "text": "4) Modernize Marijuana for Profit Laws",
      "sha256": "f609806836a12b20a05fe83023f8b34b1e2d8a1e1a8900db37d18ab22b8d56e7"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "c418106fd88afa76aae0fac6",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "47",
      "locator": "paragraph 47",
      "text": "(and keep it tightly focused)",
      "sha256": "8d0b644bbb5ce6f6b3469e59e1e4c6078cee8f60e6d4b88c1442a004046f6fb9"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "0a629e696070ea807619c7ba",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "48",
      "locator": "paragraph 48",
      "text": "Idaho’s marijuana laws are outdated—and Idaho is paying the price.",
      "sha256": "d3f64b062ab660f6ffd7ceee0f1b33bbdcc6001bd6e3544a036620db4289466e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "52f8edf08c0b83e0c4143e36",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "49",
      "locator": "paragraph 49",
      "text": "Make marijuana legally available, but tax it heavily.",
      "sha256": "5ffa2a46475fb3aceacccadb1de5d56d4e0715f56361d388cdccd8cf8d7624d3"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "75893bc3e9fac969ec2224b3",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "50",
      "locator": "paragraph 50",
      "text": "Stop sending Idaho tax dollars to surrounding states because we refuse to acknowledge reality.",
      "sha256": "6b5f600ef6a29029aef85cd952f75320c242d6b2e3cc473473ac5a9a99c80fff"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "3aa0a5a09c89ab8cf2e97f30",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "51",
      "locator": "paragraph 51",
      "text": "Reduce the black market —because prohibition hasn’t fixed anything.",
      "sha256": "2f8cd2ddfdcc3a997406e151f532cae708a8396a5d433306d3985fa034415549"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "a9f679e01c63c21b8d2a86bc",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "52",
      "locator": "paragraph 52",
      "text": "Help reduce the prison population by focusing enforcement where it belongs.",
      "sha256": "d106bb8027f34bd73cb1982a6cffaeccec564b706a41f02f39833bbc26801412"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4ded138894a47ab4f007c2d4",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "53",
      "locator": "paragraph 53",
      "text": "Even Montana and Utah have moved forward —Idaho can too.",
      "sha256": "c564b93479f7f95683d533d6e36d7d9a80ace8183008d9d66f180c5fa3a90f47"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b241c128fdfad61a3bd44096",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "54",
      "locator": "paragraph 54",
      "text": "No other drugs. Just this one. This is a targeted policy change, not a broader drug legalization agenda.",
      "sha256": "7f3914bd87ca5d12f85f1493623db0e8c93fcd6ad1929fcdbfff21761d58817a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ce673c6ae2194c55b0f8f705",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "55",
      "locator": "paragraph 55",
      "text": "Mail",
      "sha256": "07ed6ccf6bf6393d18684d1d4f774639d44c7d2d2895fd30491ccc50614ed4ea"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "4023bfe2a059ca100c350ec7",
      "document_id": "replacement-kirkham",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
